<!-- ================= ENGLISH ================= -->
<section id="doc-en" lang="en" style="display:none">

  <p>This privacy policy explains how the <strong>Dosya Aktar</strong> Android application
  (<code>com.dosyaaktar</code>) handles personal data. By using the app you accept this policy.</p>

  <div class="box">
    <strong>In short:</strong> the app does not collect, transmit or sell any personal data.
    File transfers happen directly between devices on the same Wi-Fi network.
  </div>

  <h2>1. Data we process</h2>
  <p>The app does <strong>not collect or store</strong> personal data such as name, e-mail address,
  phone number, location, contacts, device identifiers or advertising ID. There is no account,
  registration or cloud backup.</p>
  <p>Files you send are delivered only to the receiving device you select. They never pass through
  an intermediate server and are not accessible to the developer. Received files are saved on your
  device in the <code>Downloads/DosyaAktar</code> folder.</p>

  <h2>2. Local network usage</h2>
  <p>To transfer files, your device must be discoverable on the local network. For this purpose the
  app runs a service on the LAN and offers QR-code pairing. This data never leaves your device.</p>

  <h2>3. Permissions and why they are needed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Internet / network state / Wi-Fi state:</strong> to discover devices on the local network and transfer files.</li>
    <li><strong>Wi-Fi multicast:</strong> so devices on the same network can discover each other.</li>
    <li><strong>Notifications:</strong> to show transfer progress and completion.</li>
    <li><strong>Foreground service (data sync):</strong> so a transfer keeps running when the app is in the background.</li>
    <li><strong>Install unknown apps (optional):</strong> used only to open the Android installer when the user chooses to
    install a received APK file. No silent installation occurs; Android asks for confirmation every time.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The app does not request access to the camera, microphone, location, contacts, SMS or all files in storage.</p>

  <h2>4. Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>The app uses no cookies, collects no usage data, and sends no data to third-party analytics or
  crash-reporting services.</p>

  <h2>5. Advertising</h2>
  <p>This version of the app shows no ads. If advertising is added in the future, this policy will be
  updated to cover the data practices of our advertising partners and the store listing will be
  marked as "Contains ads".</p>

  <h2>6. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>The app is not directed to children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

  <h2>7. Data security</h2>
  <p>During transfer, data exists only on the local network. Transferring over public Wi-Fi is not
  recommended; use trusted networks.</p>

  <h2>8. Policy changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be published on this page and the
  "Last updated" date will be revised.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions: <strong>ugur2941@gmail.com</strong></p>

</section>

